{"seq":2,"slug":"text-to-audio","title":"文本到音频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-audio","wordCount":2017,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本到音频生成\">文本到音频生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本到音频生成涵盖语音合成（Text-to-Speech, TTS）、音乐生成和通用音频效果生成三个子领域。音频信号是一维时序数据，采样率通常为 16kHz-48kHz，这意味着一秒钟的音频包含数万个采样点。音频生成模型需要在极长的序列上保持连贯性和自然度，同时处理音色、节奏、旋律等多层次的结构信息。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[文本到音频] --&gt; B[语音合成 TTS]&#10;    A --&gt; C[音乐生成]&#10;    A --&gt; D[音频效果]&#10;    B --&gt; E[WaveNet / Tacotron]&#10;    B --&gt; F[VITS / Bark]&#10;    B --&gt; K[CosyVoice / Kokoro 等 LLM-TTS]&#10;    C --&gt; G[MusicLM / MusicGen]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Stable Audio]&#10;    D --&gt; I[AudioLDM]&#10;    D --&gt; J[Make-An-Audio]\">graph TD\n    A[文本到音频] --&gt; B[语音合成 TTS]\n    A --&gt; C[音乐生成]\n    A --&gt; D[音频效果]\n    B --&gt; E[WaveNet / Tacotron]\n    B --&gt; F[VITS / Bark]\n    B --&gt; K[CosyVoice / Kokoro 等 LLM-TTS]\n    C --&gt; G[MusicLM / MusicGen]\n    C --&gt; H[Stable Audio]\n    D --&gt; I[AudioLDM]\n    D --&gt; J[Make-An-Audio]</pre><p>音频生成的技术演进经历了从参数合成到神经网络合成、从自回归到并行生成、从特定任务到通用生成的三次范式转换。2024 年以来第四次转换正在发生：以大语言模型为骨干的语音合成（LLM-TTS）把零样本音色克隆、流式低延迟和情感可控变成行业标配，详见下文专门小节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>音频表示</th>\n<th>采样率</th>\n<th>核心创新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WaveNet</td>\n<td>TTS</td>\n<td>自回归 CNN</td>\n<td>波形</td>\n<td>24kHz</td>\n<td>因果膨胀卷积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tacotron 2</td>\n<td>TTS</td>\n<td>编码器-解码器</td>\n<td>梅尔频谱</td>\n<td>22kHz</td>\n<td>注意力对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VITS</td>\n<td>TTS</td>\n<td>VAE + Flow</td>\n<td>波形</td>\n<td>22kHz</td>\n<td>端到端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bark</td>\n<td>通用语音</td>\n<td>自回归 Transformer</td>\n<td>语义 token</td>\n<td>24kHz</td>\n<td>多级 token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MusicGen</td>\n<td>音乐</td>\n<td>自回归 Transformer</td>\n<td>EnCodec token</td>\n<td>32kHz</td>\n<td>延迟模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AudioLDM 2</td>\n<td>通用音频</td>\n<td>隐空间扩散</td>\n<td>梅尔频谱</td>\n<td>16kHz</td>\n<td>语言-音频对齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"音频表示与特征编码\">音频表示与特征编码</h2><p>音频生成模型的第一个设计决策是选择合适的音频表示。原始波形保留了完整信息但维度极高，梅尔频谱图（Mel Spectrogram）通过时频变换将波形压缩为二维图像表示，离散音频 token 通过神经编解码器（如 EnCodec、SoundStream）将音频压缩为离散符号序列。</p>\n<p>梅尔频谱图将音频信号通过短时傅里叶变换（STFT）转化为时频表示，再通过梅尔滤波器组压缩频率轴。典型配置为 80 个梅尔频带、512-1024 的 FFT 窗口大小，产生的频谱图可以视为单通道图像，直接使用图像生成模型的技术栈进行处理。从梅尔频谱还原波形需要声码器（Vocoder），如 HiFi-GAN。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torchaudio&#10;&#10;class AudioProcessor:&#10;    def __init__(self, sample_rate=22050, n_mels=80, n_fft=1024, hop_length=256):&#10;        self.sample_rate = sample_rate&#10;        self.mel_transform = torchaudio.transforms.MelSpectrogram(&#10;            sample_rate=sample_rate, n_mels=n_mels,&#10;            n_fft=n_fft, hop_length=hop_length,&#10;        )&#10;        self.amplitude_to_db = torchaudio.transforms.AmplitudeToDB()&#10;&#10;    def waveform_to_mel(self, waveform):&#10;        mel = self.mel_transform(waveform)&#10;        mel_db = self.amplitude_to_db(mel)&#10;        return mel_db&#10;&#10;    def normalize_mel(self, mel_db, min_db=-80.0, max_db=0.0):&#10;        return (mel_db - min_db) / (max_db - min_db) * 2 - 1&#10;&#10;class EnCodecTokenizer:&#10;    def __init__(self, bandwidth=6.0):&#10;        self.model = torchaudio.models.EnCodec(bandwidth=bandwidth)&#10;&#10;    def encode(self, waveform):&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            codes = self.model.encode(waveform.unsqueeze(0))&#10;        return codes&#10;&#10;    def decode(self, codes):&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            waveform = self.model.decode(codes)&#10;        return waveform.squeeze(0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchaudio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AudioProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, sample_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22050</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_mels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_fft</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hop_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sample_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sample_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mel_transform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchaudio.transforms.MelSpectrogram(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            sample_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sample_rate, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_mels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_mels,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            n_fft</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_fft, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hop_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hop_length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.amplitude_to_db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchaudio.transforms.AmplitudeToDB()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waveform_to_mel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, waveform):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mel_transform(waveform)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mel_db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.amplitude_to_db(mel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mel_db</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize_mel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, mel_db, min_db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max_db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mel_db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_db) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (max_db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_db) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EnCodecTokenizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, bandwidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torchaudio.models.EnCodec(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bandwidth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bandwidth)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, waveform):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            codes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.encode(waveform.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> codes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, codes):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            waveform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.decode(codes)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> waveform.squeeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>EnCodec 和 SoundStream 是基于残差向量量化（RVQ）的神经音频编解码器。它们将 24kHz 音频压缩为多层离散 token——第一层编码最粗粒度的信息，后续层逐步添加细节。这种层次化表示天然适合自回归生成：先生成粗粒度 token 确定基本结构，再生成细粒度 token 补充细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语音合成与端到端-tts\">语音合成与端到端 TTS</h2><p>现代 TTS 系统已经从级联架构（文本分析→声学模型→声码器）演进到端到端架构。VITS（Variational Inference with adversarial learning for end-to-end Text-to-Speech）将变分推断、标准化流和 GAN 训练结合，直接从文本生成波形，实现了自然度接近人类的语音合成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph VITS 架构&#10;        T[文本] --&gt; TE[文本编码器]&#10;        TE --&gt; PRIOR[先验编码器]&#10;        PRIOR --&gt; FLOW[标准化流]&#10;        FLOW --&gt; Z[隐变量 z]&#10;        Z --&gt; DEC[HiFi-GAN 解码器]&#10;        DEC --&gt; WAV[波形]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 训练时&#10;        WAV2[真实波形] --&gt; PE[后验编码器]&#10;        PE --&gt; Z2[隐变量 z]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph VITS 架构\n        T[文本] --&gt; TE[文本编码器]\n        TE --&gt; PRIOR[先验编码器]\n        PRIOR --&gt; FLOW[标准化流]\n        FLOW --&gt; Z[隐变量 z]\n        Z --&gt; DEC[HiFi-GAN 解码器]\n        DEC --&gt; WAV[波形]\n    end\n    subgraph 训练时\n        WAV2[真实波形] --&gt; PE[后验编码器]\n        PE --&gt; Z2[隐变量 z]\n    end</pre><p>Bark 和 VALL-E 代表了基于语言模型的 TTS 新范式。它们将语音视为另一种&quot;语言&quot;，用自回归 Transformer 生成音频 token 序列。VALL-E 只需 3 秒的参考语音即可克隆说话人的音色，生成任意文本的语音。这种方法的优势是灵活性和泛化能力，但也带来了语音深度伪造的伦理风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"llm-tts-浪潮-语音合成的大模型化-2024-2026\">LLM-TTS 浪潮：语音合成的大模型化（2024–2026）</h2><p>VALL-E 指出的方向在 2024 年后成为整个行业的默认路线：语音合成的骨干从专门的声学模型换成大语言模型，业界俗称 <strong>LLM-TTS</strong>。其标准配方由三段构成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    TXT[文本] --&gt; NORM[文本正则化]&#10;    REF[秒级参考音频] --&gt; TOK[音频 tokenizer]&#10;    TOK --&gt; SEM[语义 token 提取]&#10;    NORM --&gt; LLM[LLM 骨干自回归生成]&#10;    SEM --&gt; LLM&#10;    LLM --&gt; ACO[声学 token / 流匹配解码]&#10;    ACO --&gt; VOC[声码器还原波形]&#10;    VOC --&gt; OUT[克隆音色语音]\">graph LR\n    TXT[文本] --&gt; NORM[文本正则化]\n    REF[秒级参考音频] --&gt; TOK[音频 tokenizer]\n    TOK --&gt; SEM[语义 token 提取]\n    NORM --&gt; LLM[LLM 骨干自回归生成]\n    SEM --&gt; LLM\n    LLM --&gt; ACO[声学 token / 流匹配解码]\n    ACO --&gt; VOC[声码器还原波形]\n    VOC --&gt; OUT[克隆音色语音]</pre><p>第一段是音频 tokenizer。RVQ 类编解码器把波形压缩为多层离散 token，逐层量化残差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t^{(0)} = x_t, \\qquad r_t^{(k)} = r_t^{(k-1)} - Q_k\\!\\left(r_t^{(k-1)}\\right), \\qquad c_t^{(k)} = Q_k\\!\\left(r_t^{(k-1)}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2906em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span><