</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层码本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_t^{(k)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2906em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为该层 token。另一派走单码本路线（如 Spark-TTS 的 BiCodec），用单一 token 流换取 LLM 建模的简洁性。第二段是以预训练 LLM 为骨干的自回归生成——参考音频的 token 作为前缀拼入上下文，模型由此实现零样本音色与韵律克隆，这正是「LLM 化」的含义：说话人身份不再需要显式建模，而是变成 in-context 学习问题。第三段是把 token 还原为波形的流匹配或扩散头。</p>\n<p>相比 VITS/Bark 时代，这轮浪潮带来三项可量化的能力跃迁：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零样本克隆成为标配</strong>：数秒参考音频即可复刻音色，无需逐说话人微调；</li>\n<li><strong>流式低延迟</strong>：CosyVoice 2（阿里 FunAudioLLM，论文 arXiv:2412.10117）报告首包延迟约 150ms 量级，达到准实时对话水平；</li>\n<li><strong>副语言学可控</strong>：笑声、呼吸、停顿、情绪标签进入文本接口，情感与方言控制从研究演示走向产品功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>代表系统（开放权重为主，规格以各项目发布说明为准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>发布方</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>开放情况</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ChatTTS</td>\n<td>开源社区</td>\n<td>2024-02</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>对话韵律自然、副语言学标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CosyVoice 2</td>\n<td>阿里 FunAudioLLM</td>\n<td>2024-12</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>流式双语、约 150ms 首包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F5-TTS</td>\n<td>上海交大等</td>\n<td>2024-10</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>流匹配非自回归、推理快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kokoro</td>\n<td>开源社区</td>\n<td>2025-01</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>仅 82M 参数即登第三方竞技场榜首</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spark-TTS</td>\n<td>学术-工业合作</td>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>单码本 BiCodec + Qwen 骨干</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sesame CSM</td>\n<td>Sesame</td>\n<td>2025-03</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>会话式语音、强调「临场感」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IndexTTS 系列</td>\n<td>B 站</td>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>零样本情感与时长的精细控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gpt-4o-mini-tts</td>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>2025-03</td>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>自然语言指令实时定义语气人设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>闭源商用线同期竞争激烈：ElevenLabs v3 以音频标签控制情绪表达，MiniMax Speech 系列据第三方评测在多语种自然度榜单长期领先，Cartesia 等则以状态空间架构压低端到端延迟。截至写作时（2026-08），「开源跑本地克隆、闭源做极致自然度」的双层格局已经稳定；同时语音深度伪造风险随克隆门槛下降而加剧，水印与溯源机制成为该方向的活跃议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"音乐生成与-musicgen\">音乐生成与 MusicGen</h2><p>MusicGen 是 Meta 开发的基于 Transformer 的音乐生成模型。它使用 EnCodec 将音乐编码为多层离散 token，然后用单个自回归 Transformer 以特殊的延迟模式（delay pattern）同时生成多个量化层的 token。延迟模式通过在不同量化层之间引入固定的时间偏移，使得一个 Transformer 可以并行建模多层 token 之间的依赖关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoProcessor, MusicgenForConditionalGeneration&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;processor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(&quot;facebook/musicgen-small&quot;)&#10;model = MusicgenForConditionalGeneration.from_pretrained(&quot;facebook/musicgen-small&quot;)&#10;&#10;inputs = processor(&#10;    text=[&quot;cheerful acoustic guitar melody with gentle drums&quot;],&#10;    padding=True, return_tensors=&quot;pt&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;audio_values = model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=256, do_sample=True, temperature=1.0)&#10;sampling_rate = model.config.audio_encoder.sampling_rate&#10;print(f&quot;Generated {audio_values.shape[-1] / sampling_rate:.1f}s audio at {sampling_rate}Hz&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoProcessor, MusicgenForConditionalGeneration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"facebook/musicgen-small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MusicgenForConditionalGeneration.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"facebook/musicgen-small\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> processor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cheerful acoustic guitar melody with gentle drums\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_tensors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">audio_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.generate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">do_sample</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampling_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model.config.audio_encoder.sampling_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Generated </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">audio_values.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampling_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.1f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">s audio at </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampling_rate</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Hz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AudioLDM 将隐空间扩散模型应用于音频生成。它使用 VAE 将梅尔频谱压缩到隐空间，然后在隐空间中执行文本条件扩散。AudioLDM 2 引入了&quot;音频语言&quot;概念——先用语言模型生成音频的语义表示（AudioMAE 特征），再用扩散模型在该语义表示条件下生成梅尔频谱。这种两阶段设计在保持生成质量的同时提升了文本-音频对齐精度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>音乐模型</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>音质</th>\n<th>多样性</th>\n<th>可控性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MusicGen</td>\n<td>自回归 Transformer</td>\n<td>文本/旋律</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MusicLM</td>\n<td>层次化自回归</td>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stable Audio</td>\n<td>隐空间扩散</td>\n<td>文本+时长</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AudioLDM 2</td>\n<td>语义+扩散</td>\n<td>文本/音频</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((文本到音频))&#10;    音频表示&#10;      波形&#10;      梅尔频谱&#10;      离散 Token&#10;    语音合成&#10;      VITS 端到端&#10;      VALL-E 语音克隆&#10;      LLM-TTS 浪潮&#10;    音乐生成&#10;      MusicGen 延迟模式&#10;      Stable Audio&#10;      AudioLDM 扩散&#10;    核心挑战&#10;      长序列建模&#10;      音质保真&#10;      可控性\">mindmap\n  root((文本到音频))\n    音频表示\n      波形\n      梅尔频谱\n      离散 Token\n    语音合成\n      VITS 端到端\n      VALL-E 语音克隆\n      LLM-TTS 浪潮\n    音乐生成\n      MusicGen 延迟模式\n      Stable Audio\n      AudioLDM 扩散\n    核心挑战\n      长序列建模\n      音质保真\n      可控性</pre><ul>\n<li>音频表示的选择（波形、梅尔频谱、离散 token）决定了模型的架构和训练策略</li>\n<li>现代 TTS 已实现端到端合成，VITS 结合 VAE 和 GAN 达到接近人类自然度</li>\n<li>LLM-TTS 浪潮（2024–2026）把语音合成的骨干换成大语言模型：零样本克隆、百毫秒级流式首包与情感可控成为标配</li>\n<li>MusicGen 的延迟模式允许单个 Transformer 同时建模多层量化 token</li>\n<li>AudioLDM 将隐空间扩散应用于音频，两阶段设计提升了语义对齐</li>\n<li>音频生成面临长序列建模、实时性和音质保真的多重挑战</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文本到音频生成","id":"文本到音频生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"音频表示与特征编码","id":"音频表示与特征编码"},{"level":2,"text":"语音合成与端到端 TTS","id":"语音合成与端到端-tts"},{"level":2,"text":"LLM-TTS 浪潮：语音合成的大模型化（2024–2026）","id":"llm-tts-浪潮-语音合成的大模型化-2024-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"音乐生成与 MusicGen","id":"音乐生成与-musicgen"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文本到视频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-video"},"next":{"title":"文本到三维生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-3d"}}